  "description": "White forward fuselage with 'CONTOUR' in big blue capitals over the windows. Behind the wing the fuselage turns blue in curved bands, pale, sky and mid blue, sweeping down and forward like contour lines, then royal blue to the tail with navy along the lower aft fuselage. The fin is faceted in blues (navy along the upper leading edge, a pale band down its middle, royal aft) with the Contour mark low on it: a navy ring round a white disc, a white bar running across the fin through it and a thin white line up from it. Royal blue engines with 'contourairlines.com' in white.",
